Zou Office playground
=====================

The pixel-office renderer, character sprites, desk/furniture drawing, layout
engine, and speech-bubble rendering are adapted from:

  pixel-agents-openclaw
  https://github.com/isnardokun/pixel-agents-openclaw
  Copyright (c) 2026 isnardokun
  Licensed under the MIT License (see LICENSE in this directory).

The original project visualizes OpenClaw gateway agents. This adaptation
replaces the gateway transport with Zunesha's `/api/tasks` snapshot and `/ws`
stream, removes the OpenClaw admin/setup/hardware features, and maps task
lifecycle states to working / waiting / idle / sleeping / done / error. The
surrounding control-room UI (task rail, inspector, plan/run/review controls,
live logs, Markdown output) is original Zunesha code.
